# The controller's test from the Controller page with a virtual Xbox pad:
# its back button pressed and let go, the d-pad, the shoulders and Start
# move nothing of the window -- the test stays up, on the same tab -- until
# the back button is held a second; its letting go after goes back nowhere.
# Then the test again, and Esc from the keys.
pad attach xbox
wait 1.5
expect home
find Settings
key Return
wait 0.5
find Controller
key Return
wait 0.5
expect settings Controller
find Test the controller...
key Return
wait 0.3
expect padtest
pad button 1 down
wait 0.2
pad button 1 up
wait 0.2
pad button 12 down
wait 0.5
pad button 12 up
pad button 10 down
wait 0.1
pad button 10 up
pad button 6 down
wait 0.1
pad button 6 up
pad axis 5 1
wait 0.3
pad axis 5 -1
wait 0.3
expect padtest
pad button 1 down
wait 1.4
expect settings Controller
pad button 1 up
wait 0.4
expect settings Controller
find Test the controller...
key Return
wait 0.3
expect padtest
key Escape
wait 0.3
expect settings Controller
quit
